== resolved posture ==
  add-ons                browser,docker (sandbox)
  agent evidence         verbose
  auth var               CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN
  brokered               (unset)
  credentials            forward
  detected keys          anthropic
  egress tier            allowlist
  enforced by            sbx — Kit network allowlist + credential proxy (proveo runs no Squid or MITM)
  harness hosts          (unset)
  image                  proveo/claudecode:local (local build)
  local model            (unset)
  model roles            main=claude-opus-5 (anthropic)
  observability          sbx/policy-log.json — the daemon's allowed/blocked hosts (no MITM, so no DLP or body scan)
  reachable hosts        .anthropic.com
  role providers         anthropic
  sbx mcp gateway        declined (MCP_GATEWAY_URL empty; PROVEO_SBX_MCP=on to allow)
  target                 claudecode
  workspace              mounted checkout — the agent edits it directly
